  "method": "OpenStreetMap ways 1525136503, 1525136504, 1371322442, 1371322439 used verbatim as one MultiPolygon. The five buildings of the HL-LHC Point 5 complex are MapCERN Facilities 3555, 3560, 3581, 3569 and 3577 (SD57, SE57, SU57, SF57 and SHM57); the CERN article gives the layout (a cluster of SD, SU and SE buildings at the head of the shaft, stand-alone SF and SHM buildings, about 3300 m2 of buildings per Point) and the project news names the PM57 shaft and these buildings at Point 5. OSM maps SE57 and SU57 as one polygon (1018 m2; the official outlines are 375 and 679 m2).",
